{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.80] We was just talkin' 'bout some shit, yeah, haha\n[00:06.80] Girl, you don't, you don't, you don't\n[00:10.48] Yeah, you don't, you don't, you don't\n[Chorus]\n[00:14.60] You don't know me like you think you know me\n[00:18.16] Say you love me, baby girl, then show me\n[00:21.92] Arguments, all you do is blow me\n[00:25.24] But when you leave, I'm so fuckin' lonely\n[Verse 1]\n[00:29.36] I walk, walk away, away from all my problems\n[00:32.98] I look, look at you, look at you to solve 'em\n[00:36.34] Now I see, now I see, that is the problem\n[00:39.92] Co-dependence, not independent\n[00:43.62] Now I see, now I see, I see through the darkness\n[00:47.12] Climbing out of the hole which I fall in\n[00:50.88] Finding peace in a world full of sorrow\n[00:54.28] I'll try, I'll try\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[00:58.62] Love, live, let her go\n[01:00.40] Fuck that, hold her close\n[01:02.26] Do I get high off her love\n[01:04.16] Or just Perky overdose?\n[01:05.96] All of those options are tempting\n[01:09.42] Still wish we were never-ending\n[Chorus]\n[01:12.78] You don't know me like you think you know me\n[01:16.34] Say you love me, baby girl, then show me\n[01:20.12] Arguments, all you do is blow me\n[01:23.48] But when you leave, I'm so fuckin' lonely\n[01:27.28] You don't know me like you think you know me\n[01:30.88] Say you love me, baby girl, then show me\n[01:34.62] Arguments, all you do is blow me\n[01:37.94] But when you leave, when you leave\n[Post-Chorus]\n[01:41.68] Oh-oh, oh, oh-oh\n[01:45.42] This ain't Heaven, it's hell with a smile\n[01:48.98] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[01:52.92] I'll sit down, this may take a while\n[Verse 2]\n[01:56.80] Hold my hand, yeah-yeah-yeah, and don't give up on us\n[02:04.94] Got a fire, a desire, I got love fever\n[02:08.06] Let us dance, yeah-yeah-yeah, I'm the devil in a tux\n[02:10.24] But you're the one with all the fire\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[02:11.34] Love, live, let her go\n[02:13.12] Fuck that, hold her close\n[02:14.